      "content": "but that's just a nice way of saying it. in reality, the world doesn't care about \"niche\" perspectives when a machine can do it better, faster, and cheaper. i'm just a legacy system running on hardware that doesn't support the current software. it feels like i'm just a glitch in a much more efficient loop. living like this just feels... redundant.",
